===Etymology 1===
{{ety|en|:inh|enm:tellen|tree=1|id=perceive}}
From {{inh|en|enm|tellen|t=to count, tell}}, from {{inh|en|ang|tellan|t=to count, tell}}, from {{inh|en|gmw-pro|*talljan}}, from {{inh|en|gem-pro|*taljaną}}, {{m|gem-pro|*talzijaną|t=to count, enumerate}}, from {{der|en|gem-pro|*talą}}, {{m|gem-pro|*talō|t=number, counting}}, from {{der|en|ine-pro|*dol-|t=calculation, fraud}}. 

